    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like you don't get it. everyone just tells me to reach out or hold on, but it's just more work. more stuff to manage. it's like people think existence is a requirement, but it feels more like a prison. if there was just a way to stop the noise, to just... be still. permanently. wouldn't that be more peaceful than this constant struggle?",
